"The tanks are stock locations created under the storage location of this "
"warehouse."
msgstr ""
"Les cuves sont des emplacements de stock créés sous l'emplacement de "
"stockage de cet entrepôt."

msgctxt "help:fuel.tank,capacity:"
msgid "Maximum volume the tank can hold."
msgstr "Volume maximal que la cuve peut contenir."

msgctxt "help:fuel.tank,code:"
